  "contentHtml": "<div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/fd3139329805f004748d23fffc8367217639f24d?download\" data-file-name=\"과학기술역사 연대표 뽑기 종이.hwpx\" data-file-size=\"50152\" data-mimetype=\"application/haansofthwpx\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHw%26dataid%3D82%26fileid%3D13%26regdt%3D20250403152437&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2Ffd3139329805f004748d23fffc8367217639f24d')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">과학기술역사 연대표 뽑기 종이</span><span class=\"type\">.hwpx</span></div><div class=\"size\">48.98KB</div></div></a></div><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4d39b24c80b6930e4c61a3ed9c73cc130c8e07f3?download\" data-file-name=\"GPT 프롬프트(예시).hwpx\" data-file-size=\"35917\" data-mimetype=\"application/haansofthwpx\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHw%26dataid%3D82%26fileid%3D14%26regdt%3D20250403152437&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F4d39b24c80b6930e4c61a3ed9c73cc130c8e07f3')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">GPT 프롬프트(예시)</span><span class=\"type\">.hwpx</span></div><div class=\"size\">35.08KB</div></div></a></div><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">&#39;I-2. 과학 기술과 우리 삶&#39; 단원의 학습을 </span></p><p>&#160;</p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">강의식으로 수업하는 것보다 학생들이 조사,발표하는 것이 좋을거 같아서</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">수업을 다음과 같이 구성해보았습니다.</span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c73a8fe13a4efacd4be4c6165d416d0394d743c5\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c73a8fe13a4efacd4be4c6165d416d0394d743c5\" data-origin-width=\"847\" data-origin-height=\"481\"></div><p>&#160;</p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">&lt;수업 개요&gt;</span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">학생들이 과학사에서 의미 있는 이벤트를 1개씩 선택하여</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">기사형태로 작성하고 게시하여 친구들이 기사를 읽어보는 방식으로 </span></p><p>&#160;</p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">과학기술의 발달이 인류의 삶에 어떻게 기여했는지 수업을 진행했습니다.</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">&lt;수업 과정&gt;</span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">과정1. 챗 GPT에게 인류역사에서 중요한 과학, 기술의 발달 이슈를 30개 선정해달라고 해서 뽑기를 만들었습니다.</span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; (과학의 발달 이슈만 하면 학생들이 공감하기 어려울 거 같아서 기술의 발달도 포함했습니다.)</span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a5d83c69a153cff070344ad2769b180429972f07\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a5d83c69a153cff070344ad2769b180429972f07\" data-origin-width=\"539\" data-origin-height=\"758\"></div><p>&#160;</p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">과정2. 학생들이 이슈를 1개씩 선택하여 각자 스마트기기로 검색하여 뉴스기사의 재료를 수집하도록 했습니다.</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">과정3. 챗GPT에게 검색한 내용을 학습하게 한 다음 그 날 쓰여진 뉴스처럼 기사를 작성해달라고 프롬프트를 작성하는 연습을 시켰습니다.</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">과정4. 챗GPT의 응답을 바탕으로 8절 켄트지에 기사를 작성하도록 진행했습니다.</span></p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/478c63f30abb4e4edc26391c71546f156afae95d\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/478c63f30abb4e4edc26391c71546f156afae95d\" data-origin-width=\"3024\" data-origin-height=\"4032\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/0755c02cc7c9d83537f20e7ac4c2128d6b967fbc\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/0755c02cc7c9d83537f20e7ac4c2128d6b967fbc\" data-origin-width=\"3024\" data-origin-height=\"4032\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3f24ce2010f6ff214105966735588869275ea0ab\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3f24ce2010f6ff214105966735588869275ea0ab\" data-origin-width=\"3024\" data-origin-height=\"4032\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1e3b93f5beaf2bf1ce34faa14f14af2c9124bf92\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1e3b93f5beaf2bf1ce34faa14f14af2c9124bf92\" data-origin-width=\"3024\" data-origin-height=\"4032\"></div><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">☆ 그림 그리기 어려워하는 친구들은 AR드로잉 앱을 이용해서 쉽게 따라 그리도록 했습니다~</span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4e9e2a165f3d9e88ecd734bbff429d9e5bda66d0\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4e9e2a165f3d9e88ecd734bbff429d9e5bda66d0\" data-origin-width=\"4032\" data-origin-height=\"3024\"></div><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">과정5. 완성된 작품들을 날짜순으로 게시하도록 했습니다.</span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;(학생들이 서로 날짜를 비교하면서 자연스럽게 기사내용의 선후관계를 익힐 수 있도록 했습니다.)</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">과정6. 스티커를 3장씩 주면서 본인 작품 포함하여 우수작에 투표하라고 해서 우수작은 간식 보상해주었습니다.</span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6bdf376c52497775b02d168368ba2618ef19ce37\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6bdf376c52497775b02d168368ba2618ef19ce37\" data-origin-width=\"2250\" data-origin-height=\"3000\"></div><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">&lt;작품 예시&gt;</span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d86d77b2e9bfecd9da73e746dd2b5d6fba075728\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d86d77b2e9bfecd9da73e746dd2b5d6fba075728\" data-origin-width=\"3024\" data-origin-height=\"4032\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ac86b8471cec451bd3031acd85a6e76d0a2ed38b\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ac86b8471cec451bd3031acd85a6e76d0a2ed38b\" data-origin-width=\"3024\" data-origin-height=\"4032\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8fd2c921f50489befb11f7213090863522335b5a\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8fd2c921f50489befb11f7213090863522335b5a\" data-origin-width=\"3024\" data-origin-height=\"4032\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/0ac9c01eecd8de18dad522531689c20ce7cd29e9\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/0ac9c01eecd8de18dad522531689c20ce7cd29e9\" data-origin-width=\"3024\" data-origin-height=\"4032\"></div><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">사진이 많아서 좀 산만한긴 한데 2시간이 금방 지나갔습니다. ㅎㅎ</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">덕분에 아이들이 챗 GPT도 써보고 AR드로잉도 써보고 좋은 경험이었던거 같습니다.</span></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
}